Photorealistic industrial medallion, square, straight-on, isolated on a pure flat black background, centered and filling 80 percent of the canvas. One circular object, half machine knob, half vinyl record. Rim: thick forged dark steel with a coarse knurled grip edge, worn and bead-blasted, with a thin ring of molten orange light glowing inside it. Face: black anodised metal record with fine concentric machining grooves. On the face, two centered lines of lettering in bold flowing connected script, raised brushed steel letters with molten orange glowing edges: first line "Killa", second line "YuE" (capital Y, lowercase u, capital E). Lettering very large and legible at tiny sizes. Heavy, raw, engineered. Crisp focus. No other objects, no extra text, no watermark.
